# Checkpoints written by the examples and by tests run outside tmp_path.
# Deliberately explicit rather than `*.npz`: testdata/ may one day hold a
# fixture in that format, and a gitignore that hides a fixture is a gitignore
# that costs somebody an afternoon.
checkpoints/
*.npz.partial

